# Raw source interviews, participant profiles and locally generated memory
# are intentionally omitted from this Git-ready distribution.
# Review the redistribution rights for graded outlines before publishing.
# Public, researcher-reviewed graded outline definitions can be committed.
# The source package intentionally contains no interview records/profiles/memorybank.
resources/bundled_data/InterviewData_Cumulative_Refined_14/social_research/*/processed/*
!resources/bundled_data/InterviewData_Cumulative_Refined_14/social_research/*/processed/outline_levels.json
